      <exercise id="exer-00005">
        <problem id="prob-00005">
          <para id="para-00073">Create a table with all pairs of factors of –100 that would result in a zero value of <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
          <para id="para-00074">For each pair, state the <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> value they produce. (Use as many rows as needed.)</para>
